    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Platforming meets Paperboy! Run, jump, and climb through diverse streets and buildings to make sure you deliver your packages on time! Avoid pitfalls, watch out for the locals, and keep your wits about you as there is more going on in the package delivery world that meets the eye. Prepare your uniform and help Eve keep the family business afloat as a dark and mysterious virus runs amuck. <br><br>You are Evangeline, Eve for short, and you\u2019ve recently started working at WINGS, the family delivery business. The family\u2019s legacy is on your shoulders as competition abounds; it takes all your skill, speed, and expertise in order to keep the money rolling into the coffers. You live in a zany world where technology is just beginning to make life easier for all.<br><br><strong>- Run, Climb, Swim, and race time through 30+ hand-crafted action platforming skyscrapers to get your packages delivered before time runs out!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Use powerups such as a jetpack and hook shot!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Launch your packages at enemies to knock them over to save time!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Cooperate or compete with friends with local multiplayer!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>-\u00a0Discover shortcuts, secrets, and hidden passageways to earn your place as the top delivery person at the WINGS company!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Platforming meets Paperboy! Run, jump, and climb through diverse streets and buildings to make sure you deliver your packages on time! Avoid pitfalls, watch out for the locals, and keep your wits about you as there is more going on in the package delivery world that meets the eye. Prepare your uniform and help Eve keep the family business afloat as a dark and mysterious virus runs amuck. <br><br>You are Evangeline, Eve for short, and you\u2019ve recently started working at WINGS, the family delivery business. The family\u2019s legacy is on your shoulders as competition abounds; it takes all your skill, speed, and expertise in order to keep the money rolling into the coffers. You live in a zany world where technology is just beginning to make life easier for all.<br><br><strong>- Run, Climb, Swim, and race time through 30+ hand-crafted action platforming skyscrapers to get your packages delivered before time runs out!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Use powerups such as a jetpack and hook shot!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Launch your packages at enemies to knock them over to save time!</strong><br><br>-\u00a0<strong>Cooperate or compete with friends with local multiplayer!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>-\u00a0Discover shortcuts, secrets, and hidden passageways to earn your place as the top delivery person at the WINGS company!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Delivery Issues is a side-scrolling package-throwing time-attack action-platformer that tests your package delivery skills against a zany world of characters and events that just happen to make an easy job... difficult.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
